WEBVTT

01:26.070 --> 01:31.590
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.200 --> 01:39.520
[Episode 9 The Heart-breaking Past]

01:45.920 --> 01:48.486
I thought you would be the one

01:48.510 --> 01:50.069
talking up there.

01:50.310 --> 01:51.716
The plan is set.

01:51.740 --> 01:53.436
It doesn't matter who comes forward.

01:53.460 --> 01:56.176
It's rare that Mingyu cares about our family affairs so much.

01:56.200 --> 01:58.266
This is a good time to train him.

01:58.290 --> 01:59.686
We can also take this chance

01:59.710 --> 02:01.740
to get to know the merchants.

02:02.450 --> 02:05.236
You never blink at any catastrophe.

02:05.260 --> 02:08.430
I really admire your charisma, Chairman Su.

02:09.589 --> 02:12.180
Once the deeds of 80,000 catties of raw silk are sold,

02:12.280 --> 02:14.116
the silk price will not rise

02:14.140 --> 02:15.706
but fall by 30%.

02:15.730 --> 02:19.640
So it can stabilize the silk market in Nandu.

02:19.910 --> 02:22.830
If the raw silk can be sent back successfully,

02:23.080 --> 02:25.340
all problems will be solved.

02:26.850 --> 02:28.770
If not...

02:29.280 --> 02:31.109
Peculiar tactics always help people

02:31.260 --> 02:32.960
win a battle or make a fortune.

02:33.530 --> 02:36.310
Only those who dare to gamble can win.

02:43.950 --> 02:45.400
Qian,

02:45.770 --> 02:47.316
we've already given up a lot of interest.

02:47.340 --> 02:49.340
Why are they still hesitating?

02:51.160 --> 02:53.140
Do as Lady Su said.

02:53.290 --> 02:54.830
It'll definitely work.

02:58.820 --> 03:00.186
Guys.

03:00.210 --> 03:01.660
Guys!

03:01.840 --> 03:03.360
As you all know,

03:03.400 --> 03:05.306
we, the Su family, used to ship silk

03:05.330 --> 03:06.536
all by water.

03:06.560 --> 03:07.826
But now, the Cao Sect

03:07.850 --> 03:10.896
has stopped all the cargo ships from Yangzhou to Nandu.

03:10.920 --> 03:12.466
I think you are worried that

03:12.490 --> 03:14.570
it'll be hard to honour the deeds

03:15.190 --> 03:17.750
if the raw silk can't be sent into the city.

03:18.960 --> 03:21.186
But in business,

03:21.210 --> 03:22.366
the first is to keep your word,

03:22.390 --> 03:23.880
the second is to be faithful,

03:23.960 --> 03:26.410
and the last is to seek profits.

03:26.960 --> 03:29.040
Our Su family has been royal suppliers for a century,

03:29.219 --> 03:31.490
and we're always trustworthy.

03:31.530 --> 03:34.216
We chose water transport

03:34.240 --> 03:36.306
because delivering by post roads took a longer time

03:36.330 --> 03:37.826
and cost more.

03:37.850 --> 03:40.266
But the recent rise in the silk price

03:40.290 --> 03:41.846
balances the cost.

03:41.870 --> 03:44.296
The post roads are the best choice now.

03:44.320 --> 03:45.746
Of course,

03:45.770 --> 03:49.430
you might think the bandits are rampant on the post roads.

03:49.590 --> 03:51.986
We Su family has paid a lot

03:52.010 --> 03:55.026
to hire the prestigious Four Armed Escort Agencies

03:55.050 --> 03:57.570
to ensure the safety of the goods.

03:57.630 --> 03:59.200
And I, Su Mingyu,

03:59.400 --> 04:01.400
will go escort the goods in person this time.

04:02.120 --> 04:05.160
I swear with my life.

04:10.640 --> 04:12.090
Young Master,

04:13.040 --> 04:15.160
please don't talk recklessly again.

04:18.240 --> 04:19.575
Mr. Qin,

04:19.599 --> 04:22.239
could you read out the end of the deed

04:22.470 --> 04:24.046
to everyone?

04:24.070 --> 04:25.520
Yes.

04:26.230 --> 04:30.276
The deal is closed with a cash purchase.

04:30.300 --> 04:33.610
No registration, and free exchange.

04:34.000 --> 04:34.600
Well...

04:34.600 --> 04:37.800
The raw silk price in Nandu has been soaring,

04:37.950 --> 04:40.016
just because someone's storing it to sell it

04:40.040 --> 04:41.096
at a higher price.

04:41.120 --> 04:42.606
We merchants all speak from a business standpoint.

04:42.630 --> 04:44.950
So Chairman Su has no intention of accusing you.

04:45.090 --> 04:48.080
But the Chamber of Commerce is responsible for keeping the price down.

04:48.670 --> 04:50.730
So Chairman Su decided that

04:52.200 --> 04:54.786
the deeds could be traded freely.

04:54.810 --> 04:58.810
Now, our price is still two taels per catty.

05:02.920 --> 05:03.880
-I want it... -I want one.

05:03.880 --> 05:06.330
-Me too... -Me too...

05:08.700 --> 05:12.010
[Deed]

05:08.700 --> 05:12.460
[Two taels of silver per catty of raw silk. 80,000 catties in total. Delivery within 15 days.]

05:09.540 --> 05:11.186
The deeds of 80,000 catties of raw silk

05:11.210 --> 05:12.616
have been mostly sold.

05:12.640 --> 05:14.186
Once this stuff's gaining ground,

05:14.210 --> 05:16.400
the price of raw silk will surely plummet

05:16.480 --> 05:18.640
by around 30%.

05:19.000 --> 05:20.016
Master,

05:20.040 --> 05:21.956
we spent over 100,000 taels of silver

05:21.980 --> 05:23.840
and stored 50,000 catties of raw silk.

05:24.070 --> 05:25.906
It's time to dump it.

05:25.930 --> 05:29.190
We can make half the profit if we dump at this time.

05:29.860 --> 05:32.966
It’s quite safe for our Cao Sect.

05:32.990 --> 05:34.525
You would make a name for yourself in this battle.

05:34.549 --> 05:36.216
And in the future, no one in Nandu

05:36.240 --> 05:37.775
will dare to look down

05:37.799 --> 05:40.520
on our Cao Sect, including that Tang Xiao.

05:43.049 --> 05:45.250
You know what I want.

05:48.040 --> 05:49.490
Master,

05:50.040 --> 05:51.680
we have ample time.

05:52.310 --> 05:54.110
Why don’t we achieve it step by step?

05:54.210 --> 05:57.950
The plan of deeds is already the Su family's final counterattack.

05:58.030 --> 06:00.726
We'd better just give up

06:00.750 --> 06:02.460
this Pyrrhic victory.

06:03.500 --> 06:04.950
Ding Yi,

06:05.760 --> 06:07.620
I'm thinking about something.

06:08.700 --> 06:11.126
Su Huairou is a business genius,

06:11.150 --> 06:13.450
but this plan of deeds

06:14.750 --> 06:16.606
is not what she normally uses.

06:16.630 --> 06:18.026
Last night,

06:18.050 --> 06:20.440
Qian Rong invited Yun Xiang into Su's Mansion.

06:22.870 --> 06:24.276
It’s him.

06:24.300 --> 06:26.276
70% of the deeds of 80,000 catties of raw silk

06:26.300 --> 06:29.140
have been sold in one day.

06:29.400 --> 06:32.290
The Su family really lives up to its commercial reputation.

06:32.900 --> 06:35.456
The more we sell, the greater the loss.

06:35.480 --> 06:36.799
This is probably the biggest bet

06:36.799 --> 06:38.560
our Su family has ever made.

06:39.150 --> 06:40.446
Don't worry, Sister.

06:40.470 --> 06:42.096
This time, I'd risk my life

06:42.120 --> 06:43.696
to bring the raw silk back.

06:43.720 --> 06:45.170
You can’t go.

06:45.990 --> 06:47.440
Sister!

06:49.170 --> 06:50.836
Not until this family calamity

06:50.860 --> 06:52.730
did I realize how selfish I was.

06:53.240 --> 06:55.946
I didn’t take any responsibility for the Su family before.

06:55.970 --> 06:57.530
And I’ve been learning martial arts since my childhood.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.446
The escort will be absolutely safe this time.

06:59.470 --> 07:00.716
Stop messing around.

07:00.740 --> 07:01.870
I’ve staked all the lives

07:01.890 --> 07:03.416
of our Su family

07:03.440 --> 07:04.926
to fight for the last chance.

07:04.950 --> 07:08.290
I won't risk your life again.

07:10.200 --> 07:11.456
Chairman Su,

07:11.480 --> 07:14.160
Mr. Su just promised to escort in person

07:14.480 --> 07:15.636
in front of

07:15.660 --> 07:17.176
so many merchants.

07:17.200 --> 07:18.716
If he goes back on his word now,

07:18.740 --> 07:20.860
what will those merchants think?

07:21.270 --> 07:22.796
What worries them the most today

07:22.820 --> 07:25.336
is that this batch of raw silk can’t be shipped to Nandu,

07:25.360 --> 07:27.000
and their deeds can't be honoured.

07:27.880 --> 07:30.240
If Mr. Su goes to escort the goods in person,

07:30.730 --> 07:31.976
on one hand,

07:32.000 --> 07:35.120
it can show the confidence and determination of your Su family.

07:35.210 --> 07:37.076
On the other hand, it can assure the merchants

07:37.100 --> 07:40.500
that these deeds can be honoured in time.

07:41.080 --> 07:44.490
In this case, you can both reassure people

07:44.650 --> 07:46.310
and stabilize the price.

07:47.180 --> 07:50.000
I know, of course.

07:51.000 --> 07:52.446
I understand.

07:52.470 --> 07:53.816
You're of the same blood.

07:53.840 --> 07:55.136
How about this?

07:55.160 --> 07:57.216
I'll send "Ten Taels of Gold" and Shu Yanan

07:57.240 --> 07:58.836
to escort Mr. Su there.

07:58.860 --> 08:00.776
Both of them are top martial arts masters

08:00.800 --> 08:03.196
who risk their lives in the martial world.

08:03.220 --> 08:04.106
Their escort

08:04.130 --> 08:05.896
will keep Mr. Su safe and sound.

08:05.920 --> 08:06.936
Yes, Sister.

08:06.960 --> 08:07.986
Just rest assured.

08:08.010 --> 08:09.586
Even though I'm not an invincible martial arts master,

08:09.610 --> 08:10.776
I can still protect myself

08:10.800 --> 08:12.250
when something happens.

08:15.240 --> 08:19.080
But are you not gonna have any guards by your side?

08:19.470 --> 08:21.940
It's said the people of the Cao Sect have been trying

08:22.150 --> 08:24.166
to get rid of you.

08:24.190 --> 08:27.410
Qi Tianfeng is stocking up on raw silk right now.

08:27.550 --> 08:29.620
His ambition is evident.

08:30.150 --> 08:33.236
Chairman Su, I believe you already know

08:33.260 --> 08:36.420
who he's targeting and trying to bring down.

08:47.490 --> 08:48.336
My lady,

08:48.360 --> 08:50.426
Ding Yi, the steward of Qi Tianfeng, is outside,

08:50.450 --> 08:52.720
asking to see Yun Xiang.

08:54.410 --> 08:56.440
Steward Ding of the Cao Sect has come.

08:56.510 --> 08:57.886
He wants to see you.

08:57.910 --> 08:59.360
Ding Yi?

09:01.110 --> 09:02.546
It's about time he came.

09:02.570 --> 09:03.936
How about this?

09:03.960 --> 09:06.240
Just follow our previous arrangement,

09:06.590 --> 09:09.240
and leave the rest to me.

09:25.520 --> 09:28.456
Master Qi has prepared wonderful wine and dishes at Xianfu Restaurant.

09:28.480 --> 09:30.590
We'd like to invite you to come.

09:30.770 --> 09:32.136
May I have the chance

09:32.160 --> 09:33.266
to enjoy this meal, too?

09:33.290 --> 09:35.630
Master Qi only invited Mr. Yun.

09:35.680 --> 09:38.790
Please forgive me for not making a decision by myself.

09:39.090 --> 09:40.176
Don't make it difficult for him.

09:40.200 --> 09:41.616
I'll just go with him.

09:41.640 --> 09:43.086
Beware of tricks.

09:43.110 --> 09:45.370
That would be more interesting.

09:47.240 --> 09:49.290
Mr. Ding, please lead the way.

09:49.440 --> 09:50.890
This way please, Mr. Yun.

09:59.400 --> 10:00.850
Qian,

10:00.930 --> 10:02.096
what should we do now?

10:02.120 --> 10:03.746
In this situation,

10:03.770 --> 10:06.170
Mr. Yun went to see Qi Tianfeng alone.

10:08.200 --> 10:09.616
Young Master,

10:09.640 --> 10:11.270
I'm afraid you've thought too much.

10:11.870 --> 10:13.246
How can we figure out

10:13.270 --> 10:16.660
the thoughts of someone like Yun Xiang?

10:51.130 --> 10:53.090
You and I have fought several times.

10:53.480 --> 10:55.800
And we finally meet each other today.

10:57.240 --> 10:58.720
In a battle between two armies,

10:58.920 --> 11:00.710
there's no need for the commanders-in-chief to charge at the front.

11:33.110 --> 11:36.630
Fragrant and soft as silk.

11:38.230 --> 11:39.336
It's puffer meat.

11:39.360 --> 11:40.576
Yes.

11:40.600 --> 11:42.840
I've been suffering from a chronic illness.

11:43.240 --> 11:44.856
Fortunately, I got a secret remedy.

11:44.880 --> 11:47.480
Make soup with puffer meat

11:48.150 --> 11:50.450
and heal with its slight poison.

11:50.760 --> 11:52.210
How's the effect?

11:52.710 --> 11:54.670
I've recovered 70%.

11:56.410 --> 11:58.720
The Iron Hand Demon with 70% power

11:59.390 --> 12:01.050
is already invincible in Nandu.

12:03.820 --> 12:07.020
My internal injury was not caused by anyone else,

12:07.080 --> 12:09.576
but by my overly fierce palm technique

12:09.600 --> 12:11.420
which has hurt my meridians.

12:12.030 --> 12:14.566
There's also a fatal flaw in the strange moving technique

12:14.590 --> 12:17.410
you just used, I guess.

12:18.660 --> 12:20.976
Judging from your breath, you don't look like

12:21.000 --> 12:23.000
someone with a powerful internal force.

12:24.440 --> 12:28.306
I guess it consumes a lot of internal force,

12:28.330 --> 12:30.690
or it can't last long.

12:32.240 --> 12:36.690
My moving technique can only last 10 breaths.

12:42.960 --> 12:44.840
You told me your fatal flaw yourself.

12:45.620 --> 12:47.550
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you?

12:48.350 --> 12:49.800
To kill me,

12:50.810 --> 12:52.700
you didn't have to go through all this trouble.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.450
Master Qi,

12:56.880 --> 12:58.560
let’s just get to the point.

13:04.070 --> 13:06.380
You remind me

13:07.110 --> 13:10.350
of how Wen Cong used to be when he just came to Nandu.

13:15.590 --> 13:18.580
I'm afraid it’s inappropriate

13:18.910 --> 13:20.296
to mention Mr. Wen so flippantly.

13:20.320 --> 13:22.980
Did the Yuntai Sect send you to take revenge?

13:23.400 --> 13:24.850
Yes,

13:25.440 --> 13:26.890
or no.

13:27.160 --> 13:29.640
Is it also your idea

13:30.480 --> 13:32.360
to let the Su family sell the deeds?

13:32.960 --> 13:34.016
Exactly.

13:34.040 --> 13:35.516
You should know

13:35.540 --> 13:38.526
I will never let the raw silk be delivered to the city.

13:38.550 --> 13:40.256
Business is similar to martial arts.

13:40.280 --> 13:42.176
If you use too much force,

13:42.200 --> 13:44.760
it might backfire.

13:45.020 --> 13:48.750
I heard the cruel Taotie was carved

13:49.120 --> 13:51.120
on the bronze ware of the previous dynasty.

13:51.630 --> 13:53.200
Taotie likes eating people.

13:53.400 --> 13:56.610
But due to a miscalculation, it was stuffed

13:57.300 --> 13:59.220
to death.

13:59.540 --> 14:00.986
Master Qi,

14:01.010 --> 14:04.410
the Su's business is not that easy to swallow in one gulp.

14:06.510 --> 14:08.760
Am I the only one who resembles the Taotie?

14:09.490 --> 14:12.326
If the Su family surrenders now,

14:12.350 --> 14:14.766
they'll only lose their commercial reputation,

14:14.790 --> 14:16.976
or at most the title of the royal supplier.

14:17.000 --> 14:20.120
But now, by selling deeds,

14:20.930 --> 14:23.930
they're betting on the Su family's century-old foundation.

14:24.200 --> 14:25.690
You

14:26.960 --> 14:29.240
pushed the Su family to their doom.

14:30.210 --> 14:32.056
You'll wait until both the Cao Sect and the Su family

14:32.080 --> 14:34.270
are about to lose,

14:35.290 --> 14:38.940
so you can reap the benefits easily, right?

14:40.230 --> 14:44.130
Don’t you also wanna kill two birds with one stone, Master Qi?

14:44.960 --> 14:48.350
You wanna destroy the Su family and me,

14:49.080 --> 14:52.160
and replace us.

14:58.240 --> 15:01.520
I think we'd better call it a day.

15:04.000 --> 15:06.040
When everything's clear,

15:06.820 --> 15:08.270
we'll meet again.

15:08.760 --> 15:10.210
Okay.

15:29.530 --> 15:33.950
[Liansheng House]

15:33.830 --> 15:35.630
I knew you were an orphan.

15:35.720 --> 15:38.360
But I thought you grew up in a charity.

15:39.600 --> 15:42.480
I was lucky and met a good person.

15:42.600 --> 15:45.120
But what will happen to those kids?

15:47.540 --> 15:48.526
I can't imagine.

15:48.550 --> 15:50.216
Anyway, listen to me.

15:50.240 --> 15:52.036
You can't find those kids

15:52.060 --> 15:54.580
all by yourself.

15:56.290 --> 15:57.740
He's coming.

15:58.010 --> 15:59.486
The light went out.

15:59.510 --> 16:01.560
I thought you all left me behind.

16:02.200 --> 16:03.526
How's it? Where's Miss Ke?

16:03.550 --> 16:05.326
Didn't you point the finger at her idleness?

16:05.350 --> 16:08.336
She went to hire the head dealer and servants early in the morning.

16:08.360 --> 16:10.040
Are you satisfied, Boss?

16:10.270 --> 16:11.720
This is the right way.

16:11.930 --> 16:13.176
If you have nothing else to say,

16:13.200 --> 16:14.810
don't get in the way of our drinking.

16:15.200 --> 16:17.520
The Su's trade caravan will set off tomorrow.

16:17.990 --> 16:18.860
This time

16:18.880 --> 16:21.276
we've assembled the best armed escort agencies in Nandu,

16:21.300 --> 16:23.750
whose members all have their unique techniques,

16:24.540 --> 16:25.856
but I still think

16:25.880 --> 16:29.270
we need a commander with unparalleled martial arts skills.

16:36.190 --> 16:37.640
Jin,

16:37.740 --> 16:39.210
in my heart,

16:39.240 --> 16:41.160
you're the perfect choice.

16:42.310 --> 16:43.946
According to the news spreading out there,

16:43.970 --> 16:45.556
for the Su's trade caravan,

16:45.580 --> 16:48.920
over ten gangs of bandits along the river have gathered.

16:49.510 --> 16:51.390
In this fight,

16:51.520 --> 16:53.056
how many people have I gotta kill?

16:53.080 --> 16:53.766
As usual,

16:53.790 --> 16:55.446
10 taels of gold per person.

16:55.470 --> 16:58.600
What’s the current price of silk in Yangzhou?

16:59.150 --> 17:00.686
One tael of silver for three catties of silk.

17:00.710 --> 17:03.320
And what’s the price of the Sus' deeds?

17:04.080 --> 17:06.800
Two taels of silver per catty of silk.

17:07.800 --> 17:11.560
The Su family has sold deeds of 80,000 catties of raw silk.

17:11.610 --> 17:13.800
After this delivery, they're gonna earn

17:15.680 --> 17:17.240
at least 100,000 taels.

17:17.570 --> 17:18.610
But even if I fight so hard and break my sword,

17:18.630 --> 17:21.180
do you think I can earn 1,000 taels?

17:34.710 --> 17:38.580
Then Jin, how about you name a price?

17:40.830 --> 17:42.066
I don't want any remuneration.

17:42.090 --> 17:43.296
But you must get all the children

17:43.320 --> 17:44.526
of Jishan Hall back.

17:44.550 --> 17:45.936
How can I find them?

17:45.960 --> 17:47.436
Backed by the Yuntai Sect,

17:47.460 --> 17:48.990
you can definitely figure out a way.

17:54.100 --> 17:55.550
Why are you looking at her?

17:55.800 --> 17:58.520
I already know you so well.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.760
Maybe I can find them.

18:03.120 --> 18:05.616
But if I bring back such a large group of orphans,

18:05.640 --> 18:07.306
how should they be accommodated and raised?

18:07.330 --> 18:08.416
And who will take care of them?

18:08.440 --> 18:09.806
You.

18:09.830 --> 18:11.416
You pay to rebuild the charity

18:11.440 --> 18:13.366
and hire a teacher to teach them how to read

18:13.390 --> 18:15.030
when they're old enough for that.

18:15.600 --> 18:18.096
Those overachievers will find their way naturally,

18:18.120 --> 18:19.376
while the others

18:19.400 --> 18:22.520
can stay in this Liansheng House and work here

18:22.550 --> 18:24.130
so that they won't starve to death.

18:27.740 --> 18:29.190
What?

18:29.470 --> 18:30.796
Do you think the price is too high?

18:30.820 --> 18:32.300
Too high to reach.

18:32.560 --> 18:34.010
Then just cut the crap,

18:34.510 --> 18:35.960
and find someone else.

18:36.760 --> 18:38.210
Commander Jin!

18:39.120 --> 18:40.940
Pack your bags now.

18:43.660 --> 18:45.110
Cheers!

19:01.960 --> 19:04.416
You let Jin name such a high price to me.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.496
What if I refuse?

19:05.520 --> 19:07.096
You would agree no matter what price he asked for.

19:07.120 --> 19:08.416
Ten Taels of Gold and I must both be there

19:08.440 --> 19:09.876
for the Su family's business this time,

19:09.900 --> 19:11.586
because you need to let Qi Tianfeng know

19:11.610 --> 19:13.330
you've staked everything you have.

19:14.840 --> 19:16.606
Have you told him all my arrangements?

19:16.630 --> 19:18.216
I just wanna help him get those children back.

19:18.240 --> 19:20.560
I'll keep my mouth shut about what I'm not supposed to say.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.746
You're a fast learner in how to coerce people

19:25.770 --> 19:27.056
in a smart way.

19:27.080 --> 19:29.200
It's just an eye for an eye.

19:43.190 --> 19:44.950
It's not that I didn't want to help.

19:45.440 --> 19:49.526
But we need to prioritize the tasks, right?

19:49.550 --> 19:51.490
So you do have some human touch.

19:52.380 --> 19:53.456
Where have you been today?

19:53.480 --> 19:55.150
Why are you back so late?

19:59.230 --> 20:01.000
I went to Qi Tianfeng's banquet.

20:04.240 --> 20:05.690
Qi Tianfeng?

20:13.840 --> 20:14.880
Qi Tianfeng already knew

20:14.880 --> 20:16.766
it was my idea to use the raw silk deeds.

20:16.790 --> 20:18.656
He just wanted to sound out the facts.

20:18.680 --> 20:20.120
And I also wanted to know

20:20.120 --> 20:21.916
what his next move would be.

20:21.940 --> 20:24.310
If he starts to dump the raw silk now,

20:24.880 --> 20:26.126
we can only see him

20:26.150 --> 20:27.816
escape unscathed.

20:27.840 --> 20:29.520
Will he

20:30.180 --> 20:31.630
dump it now?

20:32.190 --> 20:34.830
He wants more than these penny profits.

21:05.840 --> 21:07.290
What is this?

21:08.240 --> 21:10.416
I wanted to test his martial arts skills.

21:10.440 --> 21:14.066
And I got this by accident.

21:14.090 --> 21:16.256
If he didn't come for revenge,

21:16.280 --> 21:17.950
then he's stirred up trouble

21:18.480 --> 21:21.296
just to do what Wen Cong failed to finish back then

21:21.320 --> 21:22.886
and control the business world in Nandu.

21:22.910 --> 21:25.630
Isn't it the usual tactic of the Yuntai Sect?

21:25.920 --> 21:27.370
Master,

21:27.440 --> 21:29.600
it will take a great deal of money

21:29.640 --> 21:31.760
to raise the price of the deeds.

21:32.360 --> 21:34.520
We have nowhere to borrow money now.

21:38.480 --> 21:43.250
[Luo]

21:45.980 --> 21:47.430
What's wrong with you?

22:12.250 --> 22:14.616
You, Young Master Xiang, never blink at any disaster.

22:14.640 --> 22:16.096
If you panic even a little,

22:16.120 --> 22:17.446
that means something big has happened.

22:17.470 --> 22:19.680
Tell me about it. Maybe I can help you.

22:28.630 --> 22:30.080
Yes, you can.

22:32.680 --> 22:35.060
Can you leave me alone? Thank you.

22:49.000 --> 22:50.640
Look at this character.

22:51.870 --> 22:53.320
Luo...

22:54.390 --> 22:55.840
The Luo family's village?

22:56.600 --> 22:58.280
He’s from the Luo family's village!

22:58.840 --> 23:01.480
I kept observing him during the meal.

23:02.360 --> 23:04.680
Still, I was almost cheated by him.

23:05.720 --> 23:07.170
This is the evidence.

23:08.560 --> 23:11.630
Yun Xiang is here for revenge.

23:12.800 --> 23:14.076
His personal revenge.

23:13.650 --> 23:15.530
[Cao Sect]

24:28.690 --> 24:30.480
I didn't expect it to be you.

24:45.260 --> 24:47.200
It was quite powerful,

24:47.360 --> 24:49.340
but not accurate.

24:55.900 --> 24:57.530
You remain cool in the face of shock.

24:58.480 --> 24:59.800
You're really not the crying little girl

24:59.800 --> 25:02.300
you used to be.

25:26.600 --> 25:29.446
The Altair Swordplay is the Shu family's orthodox technique.

25:29.470 --> 25:31.500
Unfortunately, it's not top-class.

25:53.200 --> 25:54.650
Girl,

25:54.760 --> 25:56.210
if you try again,

25:56.320 --> 25:58.720
I'm afraid I won't be interested.

26:06.640 --> 26:08.990
Sit down and have some tea.

26:10.400 --> 26:14.490
Maybe we can talk about the past.

26:24.180 --> 26:25.630
Why are you laughing?

26:26.320 --> 26:28.640
I'm laughing at my useless sympathy

26:30.150 --> 26:31.600
for not killing you back then.

26:32.440 --> 26:35.290
Wen Cong took over Shu's Armed Escort Agency.

26:36.120 --> 26:39.266
He ordered me to kill you all.

26:39.290 --> 26:40.770
My Godfather is dead.

26:41.060 --> 26:42.840
Don't talk nonsense about him.

26:47.280 --> 26:49.280
He destroyed your whole family,

26:49.570 --> 26:51.770
while he adopted you as his daughter.

26:52.360 --> 26:54.200
He wiped away the blood

26:54.880 --> 26:57.870
and blamed everything on me alone.

26:58.820 --> 27:00.856
I've been holding back for revenge over the past decade.

27:00.880 --> 27:02.810
I don't wanna wait any longer.

27:02.950 --> 27:05.036
If you slander my Godfather ever again,

27:05.060 --> 27:06.416
I will kill you

27:06.440 --> 27:07.680
even at the cost of my life!

27:07.700 --> 27:09.220
Enough.

27:10.430 --> 27:12.330
You can't kill me.

27:13.200 --> 27:15.240
Stop wasting time.

27:15.440 --> 27:16.506
Besides,

27:16.530 --> 27:19.210
you're not the one to fight in the end.

27:19.800 --> 27:22.000
I guess you came here

27:22.600 --> 27:24.890
for that thumb ring tonight.

27:25.360 --> 27:26.810
Am I right?

27:30.270 --> 27:31.720
Exactly.

27:31.950 --> 27:35.350
But you will pay with your blood one day.

27:36.120 --> 27:38.000
They're long dead.

27:38.920 --> 27:41.296
Who else knows the truth?

27:41.320 --> 27:42.770
Forget about it.

27:43.510 --> 27:45.040
I'll let you go.

27:45.160 --> 27:47.080
Send him a message.

27:48.220 --> 27:50.400
The secret about this thumb ring.

27:52.020 --> 27:53.376
The secret?

27:53.400 --> 27:54.850
What?

27:56.560 --> 27:58.800
You've been staying by his side,

27:59.080 --> 28:00.566
while you didn't even know

28:00.590 --> 28:03.350
he had such a big secret hidden in him.

29:06.630 --> 29:08.110
Did you stay up all night?

29:11.840 --> 29:13.460
Where are you going? Wait a second.

29:16.040 --> 29:17.296
Give me your hand.

29:17.320 --> 29:18.770
For what?

29:25.760 --> 29:27.440
Do not lose it again.

29:28.920 --> 29:30.410
How did you get it?

29:30.650 --> 29:32.230
Did you go to meet Qi Tianfeng?

30:11.770 --> 30:14.770
What did he tell you?

30:15.610 --> 30:16.956
Shouldn't you have asked me

30:16.980 --> 30:18.670
if he gave me a hard time first?

30:26.040 --> 30:27.670
You shouldn't have acted without my permission.

30:28.870 --> 30:30.720
If you ruined my plan,

30:31.370 --> 30:33.330
we'll lose everything.

31:16.040 --> 31:17.630
How heartless you are.

31:24.210 --> 31:25.970
When you went to Qi Tianfeng's place,

31:26.200 --> 31:27.740
did he give you a hard time?

31:30.830 --> 31:32.920
Qi Tianfeng asked me to tell you something.

31:33.320 --> 31:35.486
He said, so long as you stopped working with the Su family,

31:35.510 --> 31:37.086
he'd tell you the whole story

31:37.110 --> 31:38.770
you wanted to know.

31:41.830 --> 31:43.006
I've told you everything.

31:43.030 --> 31:44.540
No need to say goodbye.

31:44.600 --> 31:46.056
Fortunately, the world is wide.

31:46.080 --> 31:47.760
And we don't need to meet again.

31:51.690 --> 31:53.500
I'm not here to say goodbye to you.

31:59.120 --> 31:59.960
My plans have never failed.

31:59.960 --> 32:01.566
Why don't you believe me?

32:01.590 --> 32:03.136
You don't believe in my strategies,

32:03.160 --> 32:04.750
or me.

32:07.180 --> 32:08.630
You

32:10.270 --> 32:11.720
are not trustworthy.

32:27.510 --> 32:29.470
But after I heard those stories,

32:30.210 --> 32:32.170
I can understand you now.

32:34.780 --> 32:35.906
You survived out of 313 people,

32:35.930 --> 32:38.130
who were brutally murdered.

32:39.120 --> 32:42.240
if you're not vigilant or sort of cold-blooded,

32:42.960 --> 32:45.240
how can you resist the fear in your heart

32:46.040 --> 32:48.390
and endure the nightmare every night?

33:15.160 --> 33:16.790
Honestly, I'm quite envious

33:18.640 --> 33:20.090
of you sometimes.

33:22.380 --> 33:24.110
You and I are both survivors.

33:26.510 --> 33:28.340
But your heart is warm.

33:28.740 --> 33:30.230
You still have the guts to love.

33:32.280 --> 33:33.950
Love your friends,

33:35.730 --> 33:37.300
and those children.

33:39.620 --> 33:41.070
You dare to try something impossible.

33:42.340 --> 33:43.790
I'm really envious.

33:46.830 --> 33:49.000
Thanks. I'm flattered.

33:49.500 --> 33:50.606
No,

33:50.630 --> 33:52.340
I'm the one who should say thank you.

33:52.880 --> 33:54.330
Thank you.

33:57.920 --> 33:59.370
Alright...

33:59.920 --> 34:01.420
The armed escorts are about to set off.

35:09.870 --> 35:11.320
Come back safely.

35:30.440 --> 35:31.846
Look.

35:31.870 --> 35:33.790
This knot is so tough.

35:35.970 --> 35:37.560
It will never get loose again.

36:07.050 --> 36:08.850
[Su]

36:37.760 --> 36:39.526
The Su's trade caravan

36:39.550 --> 36:41.896
even outshines the Grand Coordinator's deployment to suppress the bandits.

36:41.920 --> 36:44.120
Su Mingyu really led the team in person.

36:44.190 --> 36:47.120
Jin Biao and Shu Yanan are also among them.

36:48.120 --> 36:51.246
But the bandits of all the gangs have gathered,

36:51.270 --> 36:53.330
with the help of the martial arts masters from our sect.

36:53.390 --> 36:56.420
Even if these escorts boast their unique skills,

36:56.530 --> 36:58.536
it’s not that easy to transport the raw silk

36:58.560 --> 37:00.120
into the city.

37:01.480 --> 37:03.216
Those bandits

37:03.240 --> 37:05.080
are no more than a motley crew.

37:05.620 --> 37:08.696
But we must make sure nothing goes wrong.

37:08.720 --> 37:11.920
Then I'll choose 60 more good fighters from our sect.

37:12.920 --> 37:13.720
Our men in the sect

37:13.720 --> 37:16.120
all follow us through fire and water.

37:16.360 --> 37:19.126
Give them enough rewards before their departure,

37:19.150 --> 37:21.100
and let them settle their families down.

37:21.210 --> 37:22.660
Okay.

37:25.040 --> 37:27.596
How long has this stone beast been here?

37:27.620 --> 37:29.216
Since our Cao Sect started to thrive

37:29.240 --> 37:31.190
and moved here.

37:31.760 --> 37:33.480
It's too old.

37:37.640 --> 37:39.800
We should get a new one.

37:45.470 --> 37:47.606
That guy didn't tell me his name, and he refused to leave.

37:47.630 --> 37:49.080
He insists on meeting Mr. Mo.

37:59.930 --> 38:01.696
How are you doing, Mr. Kang?

38:01.720 --> 38:03.296
How's your injury?

38:03.320 --> 38:06.120
Did we not open the main door today?

38:06.780 --> 38:09.190
I took a different road for something important, of course.

38:09.390 --> 38:12.400
Can a rascal have anything important to talk about?

38:12.630 --> 38:13.936
Mr. Mo said

38:13.960 --> 38:16.370
he had nothing to do with you anymore.

38:18.580 --> 38:20.030
Why don't you ask him one more time?

38:34.970 --> 38:37.100
I can never talk about the assassination

38:37.160 --> 38:38.836
of Ten Taels of Gold again.

38:38.860 --> 38:42.490
But those kids who have been sold

38:42.720 --> 38:44.690
are such poor things.

38:46.200 --> 38:47.466
Kang Qiao,

38:47.490 --> 38:48.856
you go arrange this.

38:48.880 --> 38:51.120
Make sure to be considerate and keep the kids safe.

38:51.320 --> 38:52.770
OK.

39:12.240 --> 39:13.506
Mr. Mo,

39:13.530 --> 39:16.130
I’m here to tell you that

39:16.640 --> 39:20.110
I can pay back the 30,000 taels of silver I owe you.

39:20.680 --> 39:21.826
Pay back?

39:21.850 --> 39:23.310
How?

39:23.510 --> 39:25.366
Did you bring the silver?

39:25.390 --> 39:27.166
15 fast cargo ships,

39:27.190 --> 39:28.640
plus the boatmen.

39:30.160 --> 39:31.856
300 mu of prime paddy fields,

39:31.880 --> 39:34.800
and more than 20 high-quality stores.

39:35.370 --> 39:39.350
The properties along the river, and a lobby of the Cao Sect's headquarters.

39:40.240 --> 39:41.690
What do you think?

39:43.870 --> 39:46.066
If the raw silk can’t be sent into the city,

39:46.090 --> 39:47.656
the Su family will fall.

39:47.680 --> 39:49.016
If it's transported into the city,

39:49.040 --> 39:50.516
the Cao Sect will lose all their money.

39:50.540 --> 39:51.950
Qi Tianfeng's estate

39:51.970 --> 39:54.560
cannot be owned by you no matter what.

39:55.520 --> 39:56.936
You're right.

39:56.960 --> 40:00.190
I've spared no effort to set up a series of schemes

40:00.290 --> 40:03.610
just to help you get something, Mr. Mo.

40:07.980 --> 40:08.936
Mr. Mo,

40:08.960 --> 40:11.480
whether the raw silk can be delivered to Nandu

40:11.640 --> 40:13.150
is not up to me,

40:13.660 --> 40:15.340
the Su family,

40:15.630 --> 40:17.840
or Qi Tianfeng.

40:18.430 --> 40:19.880
So...

40:23.570 --> 40:25.090
It's all up to you, Mr. Mo.

40:26.860 --> 40:27.416
Master,

40:27.440 --> 40:28.326
Master Qi is here,

40:28.350 --> 40:30.390
asking to talk to you about a big deal.

40:36.640 --> 40:38.090
Master Qi,

40:38.380 --> 40:39.840
you’ve borrowed

40:39.860 --> 40:41.450
from almost all the banks in Nandu.

40:41.600 --> 40:43.336
Why did you come to our Guanghui Bank so late?

40:43.360 --> 40:45.056
For the last battle,

40:45.080 --> 40:47.070
I need to turn to the No.1, of course.

40:47.300 --> 40:49.396
How much do you wanna borrow? And what's the interest?

40:49.420 --> 40:53.006
1% interest for all the other banks in Nandu.

40:53.030 --> 40:55.006
But I'll give you 3%.

40:55.030 --> 40:57.910
I can't give you more, or it will break the rule.

40:58.470 --> 41:00.306
You've already borrowed money from all the banks in Nandu.

41:00.330 --> 41:01.980
Are you talking about the rule now?

41:02.800 --> 41:04.250
I'd like to say something.

41:04.820 --> 41:06.940
You've fought against the Su family to this extent

41:07.160 --> 41:09.250
not for profit, right?

41:11.510 --> 41:12.990
What do you think?

41:13.620 --> 41:15.070
I thought

41:16.090 --> 41:19.446
this is your sink-or-swim battle.

41:19.470 --> 41:21.416
If you win, you can replace them

41:21.440 --> 41:23.476
and be the head of Nandu Chamber of Commerce,

41:23.500 --> 41:25.870
with great wealth and a prominent reputation.

41:27.640 --> 41:31.236
I heard the bandits are rampant on the post roads.

41:31.260 --> 41:34.580
I’m afraid the Su family can't get their raw silk into the city.

41:38.960 --> 41:41.210
But the overall situation in the city is still uncertain.

41:41.760 --> 41:44.366
The Su family issued the deeds of 80,000 taels of raw silk

41:44.390 --> 41:46.510
to lower the price of raw silk,

41:46.530 --> 41:48.090
which was raised by you.

41:48.240 --> 41:50.196
Master Qi, you wanna borrow so much money

41:50.220 --> 41:52.376
just to raise the price of the deeds too.

41:52.400 --> 41:54.960
Mr. Qi, am I right?

41:55.130 --> 41:59.540
So how much profit do you want, Mr. Mo?

42:00.060 --> 42:01.510
I don't want any of it.

42:01.960 --> 42:06.150
I only want 10% of the Cao Sect's monthly income.

42:07.780 --> 42:10.630
10% of the income...

42:14.280 --> 42:20.360
Everyone says that you are a ruthless profiteer.

42:20.560 --> 42:22.250
Today, I saw you

42:22.970 --> 42:24.806
even going further.

42:24.830 --> 42:27.520
What's wrong with a merchant seeking profit?

42:29.860 --> 42:32.070
I promise you

42:33.880 --> 42:35.330
10% of the income.

42:35.410 --> 42:36.856
Great!

42:36.880 --> 42:38.286
You can borrow as much money as you like.

42:38.310 --> 42:40.650
I can give you the key to the vault.

42:42.290 --> 42:43.740
But Master Qi,

42:43.770 --> 42:45.500
what will you give me as collateral?

42:46.260 --> 42:49.460
Just tell me what else you want, Mr. Mo.

42:50.670 --> 42:52.116
Master Qi,

42:52.140 --> 42:54.340
I've given you everything I have.

42:54.740 --> 42:57.300
Of course, you should mortgage something valuable with me.

42:58.120 --> 42:59.570
I think,

42:59.650 --> 43:01.890
the estate of your Cao Sect is quite suitable.

43:02.500 --> 43:04.710
[Guanghui Bank]

43:10.160 --> 43:11.610
Mr. Qi,

43:12.360 --> 43:13.960
as the old saying goes,

43:14.100 --> 43:17.050
do not forget me when you succeed.

43:19.140 --> 43:20.496
Mr. Mo, let's say goodbye here.

43:20.520 --> 43:21.970
OK.

43:24.400 --> 43:25.386
Master,

43:25.410 --> 43:26.796
how much did you borrow?

43:26.820 --> 43:28.300
Let's talk about it when we're back.
